{"summary":"Run, jump and smash! Help the little dino and his friends to beat the trogs!","description":"The little dinosaur and his friends are trying to escape from an island full of troglodytes. Help them to smash as many trogs as possible, and unleash their hidden power by collecting all the pineapples you find along the way.\n\nRUN, JUMP AND SMASH!\nPlay the game using only one finger: tap to jump, and tap again to smash the trogs! Easy to learn, but hard to master!\n\nUNLEASH THE POWER\nThe little dinosaur and his friends are adorable creatures. But they are able to transform into invincible super beasts!\n\nUNLOCK ALL THE CHARACTERS\nReach the top and collect pineapples to get the 12 characters and enjoy the adventure.\n\nENJOY THE GAME\nEnjoy the beautiful pixel art graphics, the fluid animations, and the retro-sounding music.","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$1.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aC0-uY_jl3E?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pRBc6nv70k5JPEbQinnzVkAkq1Ej5bwXdokalV5ZFWo_O7ighdICKtCnRvSnC5Tph00xhgLvzl1QHmjTfmjO","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7ADCjkcstPCNuL4fp-xzdvDzP-waRcL8kozwZ7Mw_Tq4kbwxXKdRMgISiWrqbHUIMw6xyJXMr0WSPfCJNHuie6Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PklfhvUfixRa18USB08vR9KY8HAr3yb3797zSueaq4zRVtUpMIiroo_fXDsWdmSr2moluJj2NV8M_Hfthifl","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5JFs3_Ut7b9k2jzc4osEV3KP3KzRqHTI7FeSeGQzGJeYhd5WL9MkharSbLyvhi__GPvTl6a3_n0eVPuXIBe3ow","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RKrBSWvR1-1KW3_RgyLczHZ9ETW1ii65FbWfELF0wWU5NTCD8eIrtr2O6el6AL06BSvJL0TwWvKem36C8YLz","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xdnrG9D50AEwoy9T6I7EVVtBbn4rVHdLif3GC4nBUvQIl83ChB6OP212YnEKmDcfsko4x5kr-oBsfz_Bj_-FrQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mcSYj_fpKjFIelCWVcWlbl06-A8b2aMO3qOh6ii1XQASAnkwBtlhlKcboXOsp0BH__wRIXcwccv70e6mHSjp","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gX1ZcrGTRVunH3o66B1JnDkoEDhBnbU42yaP8qBXD